interface.signature:
POST /api/v1/vouchers
Request Body: VoucherCreateRequest { date: LocalDate, description: String, periodId?: UUID, lines: VoucherLineDTO[] }
Response: 201 Created { id: UUID, voucherNumber: String } | 400 Bad Request { errors: Map<String, String> }

PUT /api/v1/vouchers/{voucherId}
Request Body: VoucherCreateRequest { date: LocalDate, description: String, periodId?: UUID, lines: VoucherLineDTO[] }
Response: 200 OK { id: UUID } | 400 Bad Request { errors: Map<String, String> } | 403 Forbidden (if not draft)

POST /api/v1/vouchers/{voucherId}/validate
Request Body: VoucherCreateRequest (same as create/update)
Response: 200 OK { valid: boolean, errors: Map<Integer, Map<String, String>> }
